Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:26:40 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] Preload pages before the click: hover, keyboard focus,
 search results, idle common tasks (not built yet)

Built into a separate preload budget of ModuleView, one at a time, cancelled by any input.
SYSTEMSETTINGS_PRELOAD=0 turns it off.

